OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Finland will mostly fade away
OL,7,Fovernight, though some will continue
OL,8,Fnear coasts where they will also be
OL,9,Fheavy at times. Clear spells
OL,10,Fdeveloping elsewhere, leading to a
OL,11,Fcooler night, especially in the
OL,12,Fcountryside.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FShowers generally less
OL,15,Fwidespread, although some thundery
OL,16,Fshowers possible, especially in
OL,17,Fwestern and southern Britain.
OL,18,FTemperatures a little below normal for
OL,19,Fmany, but still rather warm in the
OL,20,Fsoutheast.
